Dear Zoe,

=20

Once again, the respondent has been invited to choke me with his own hands,=
 and once again I feel =E2=80=9Craped=E2=80=9D, silenced, voiceless, and burnt alive.

=20

I wrote to you on 29 February 2024, and we met at 4pm at 29 Bedford Row Cha=
mbers. We discussed the matter of Oxus at length, and you explained that the=
 process involves writing to the other side. I immediately approved the draf=
t, and the email was sent (attached).

=20

Since then, the respondent has instructed his solicitors not to respond.=20

=20

I have asked you numerous times to please confirm the deadline, how long wi=
ll my destiny be in his hands, and I have not received a reply.  I have aske=
d you every single day how long I will have to bear his hands around my thro=
at, and I have not received a reply. Not knowing, not having an end date to =
this torture is intolerable; it has made me extremely distressed and has mad=
e my symptoms unmanageable.

=20

I am in the dark, powerless, voiceless, and once again, the pressure on my =
throat is being applied by the very same person who has abused me for 30 yea=
rs.=20

=20

I am unable to cope with this pressure anymore. My heart is beating too fas=
t, and my chest is hurting. I ran out of medication for my heart and for anx=
iety.=20

=20

I am going to Cromwell Hospital immediately to have my heart checked and fo=
r new prescriptions.=20

=20

When I return home, I will email His Lordship and will copy you because I a=
m powerless, and my throat is being squeezed by the respondent. I will ask H=
is Lordship what the deadline should be; how many more days should we wait f=
or the respondent to admit to this non-disclosure or the manufacture the lie=
s to deny it.

=20

I asked you for a deadline, and I did not receive a reply. I am unable to c=
ope with this and the respondent=E2=80=99s hands are choking me. I cannot carry on=
 with no guidance and no glimpse of light.

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

BV20D01752

Fraud Unravels All=20

Veritas Numquam Perit

UK: +44 79 1332 8615

US: +1 424 426 9226


